title: TownsquareScript
---
<<declare $reputation = 10>>
<<update_reputation>>
Narrator:Booted heels and walking sticks clatter noisily upon the ground, adding to the town's cacophony.
Narrator:As nightfall approached, the soul of Point Ecrin began to transform from bustling commerce to quieter evening pursuits.
Narrator:Few souls loomed by their shops as they shuttered for the eventide, but one lone figure advancing from the docks caught Nisaea's attention.
Narrator:A man clad in sea-soaked work overalls redolent of kelp and brine materialized much to Nisaea's pleasure. Though, he seems to be in a hurry.

===

title: VictorOpening
---
<<expression Victor neutral>>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Victor:"Nisaea!"
Victor:"Darling. Sorry, I have no crab for you today– traps were empty. I thought you would be gone for several weeks."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>

Nisaea:"Oh.."
    ->"I missed Point Ecrin already!"
        <<set $reputation to $reputation -1>>
        <<update_reputation>>
        //  Narrator: Your current repuation is {$reputation}! // for debugging
        <<jump VD1NEG>>
    ->"I've lost something..."
        <<set $reputation to $reputation +1>>
        <<update_reputation>>
        //  Narrator: Your current repuation is {$reputation}! // for debugging
        <<jump VD1POS>>
===

title: VD1NEG
position: 20,20
---
Nisaea:"Something about this town calls to me. I just couldn't stay away."
<<expression Victor concerned>>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
Victor:"Right... Glad to have you back then. Is everything alright? I love our chats but I'm in a bit of a bind."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"Apologies..."
<<jump VRMD>>
===
title:VD1POS
---
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"That is my intention, but as I was leaving, I noticed that something dear to me had become misplaced. I've come back into town in hopes of finding it."
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
Victor:"I'm terribly sorry to hear that. If it's quick, I'll lend you my hand."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"You have my eternal thanks."
<<jump VRMD>>
===

title:VRMD
---
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
Nisaea: Victor...
    ->"Have you seen anything suspicious?"
         <<jump VD1NEUT>>
    ->"Has anyone been acting strangely?"
         <<jump VD2NEUT>>
===

title: VD1NEUT
---
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
Victor:"You'll have to be more specific. 'Er's never a dull moment in Ecrin." 
Victor:"Jilted brides, natural philosophers from out of town, mysterious women blowing in from the southern seas, much like yourself— all the residents are characters."
<<if visited ("VD2NEUT")>>
    <<jump NRVMDB1>>
       <<else>>
        <<jump VRMD>>
<<endif>>
===

title: VD2NEUT
---
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
