title: NRVMDB1
---
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">>
Nisaea:<i>His answers are more stilted than usual. Maybe I can get him to open up somehow or figure out why he's in such haste.<i>
<<reveal_object "Ring">>
<<reveal_object "Scissors">>
<<hide_object "Victor-FullBody">>
<<hide_object "Nisaea-FullBody">>
