title: VYdecision
---
<<reveal_object "Victor-FullBody">>
<<reveal_object "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Narrator: Nisaea approaches Victor, both items in her pocket.
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Victor-FullBody">> 
