<<expression Eloise neutral>>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
 Narrator:A chill sets in the town of Port Ecrin, making Nisaea deeply aware of the insufficiency of human skin in keeping one warm.
 Narrator:Couples begin to congregate near the opera house, with one soul lingering further out near the town square's interior.
 Narrator:Drapped in brilliant lilac taffeta and florid needlepoint lace, a woman stands divided from the rest.
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
 Nisaea: Pardon. Are you...
