title: EVDNeg1
---
<<expression Eloise condescending>>
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"Are you not as <i>charming</i> as a hare with half the brain?"
Eloise:"A newcomer I surmise, dear? I'm <color=\#9370DB>Eloise</color>. Eloise Keating, at your service."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"<i>Pleasure</i>... to meet you?"
<<set $reputation to $reputation -1>>
