title: handkerchief
---
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Narrator:A silken white handkerchief with skillfully embroidered violet and lavender flowers.
Narrator:Imported or commissioned for an appropriate price.
Narrator:The letters E.K are painstakingly sewn into the corner of the fabric.
<<reveal_object "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"What beautiful flowers... I wonder if this belongs to Ms. Keating."
<<hide_object "Nisaea-FullBody">>
