title: ECNeg
---
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Narrator:A twinge of pain flashes within Eloise's eyes before she buries it deep within.
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Eloise:"Has anyone ever told you, you're quite the intrusive girl, and it's not the least bit endearing?"
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"No?"
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Narrator:Eloise groans in frustration at Nisaea's confusion.
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Eloise:"It's just expensive fabric now. I'm lucky to have got art from one of this era's most brilliant needleworkers, but that's all this ever will be." 
    <<jump EMDCont>>
===

title:ECPos
---
<<expression Eloise Condescending>>
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">> 
