<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"That's Victor's sister, yes?"
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">> 
<<expression Eloise Neutral>>
Eloise:"The <color=\#2F4F4F>crab fisherman</color>? Yes. It often slips my mind that they're related, they feel diametric to one another."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">> 
