title: EComL
---
<<expression Eloise condescending>>
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"I wouldn't waste her time with such a pitiful project. I'd ask for a veil or gloves— something grand."
Eloise:"It was a gift, of course." 
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"You're quite close then?"
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Narrator: Eloise fidgets with the handkerchief.
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<expression Eloise guarded>>
Eloise:"No. Not anymore."
    <<jump EMDCont>>
===

title:ETL
---
<<expression Eloise guarded>>
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"Our language is too limited to describe the depth our connection. Friends will suffice for now."
    <<jump EMDCont>>
===

title: EMDCont
---
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"You've lost <color=\#556B2F>Jessamine</color> somehow?"
<<expression Eloise guarded>>
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"Taken. My future, my livelihood, was taken by that fool <color=\#4682B4>Humphrey Ellis.</color>"
Eloise:"Or perhaps, I'm to blame. I've nary been a clever girl."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
    ->"Humphrey Ellis? I am unfamiliar with that name."
    ->"Should I know who Humphrey Ellis is?"
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"Haven't had the pleasure of receiving a tonic or hearing the ramblings of sea women from Point Ecrin's finest doctor? Color yourself lucky."
<<expression Nisaea nervous>>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"Sea women? Does your physician need a doctor? Heheh..."
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Narrator: Eloise does not seem amused.
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"I pray, continue."
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"My failed fiancé, <color=\#4682B4>Doctor Ellis</color>, had me preoccupied.My family was keen on us being a match, and my focus was narrowed. No time for hobbies, friends, or otherwise."
Eloise:"He however has become very distracted that our arrangement is apparently annulled. His mind has been tainted from consorting with some out-of-town philosophers."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
    ->"Has he left town?"
        <<jump LTL>>
    ->"Sea women?"
        <<jump SWL>>
===

title: SWL
---
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"How did that relate to sea women?"
<<expression Eloise guarded>>
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"These <i>'philosophers'</i> believe they have discovered a new race of people. Magical people who can transform between humans and animals on land and sea. It's absurd."
<<expression Nisaea nervous>>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"Entirely!"
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"The only explanation I received is that he met some amazing woman— one of these creatures, and became obsessed with proving their theorem."
Eloise:"I have not heard from him since."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"Where can I find him?"
<<jump EDir>>
===

title: LTL
---
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"I'm uncertain, but I believe he's still holed up in his study. It is a repurposed warehouse. I believe he and the philosophers have been studying the <i>'sea women'</i> there.."
    <<jump EDir>>
===

title: EDir
---
<<expression Eloise Neutral>>
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"I'll do my best to give you directions."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"I greatly appreciate it."
<<lightenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Eloise:"... I don't believe you said what you were searching for."
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Eloise-FullBody">>
<<expression Nisaea happy>>
Nisaea:"I don't believe I did."
<<change_scene Warehouse>>
