title: JVDNeut1
---
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
Narrator:The woman in the shop glances up from her work and looks over Nisaea.
<<lightenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
Jessamine:"I told <color=\#2F4F4F>Victor</color> I was done taking in new girls. The Mrs. doesn't need more help in the shop, and I certainly don't require more apprentices."
<<darkenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"N-No, I'm not in search of a job... I do need help, but not in <i>that</i> way." 
