title:JVDPOS1
---
<<lightenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Jessamine:"<color=\#2F4F4F>Victor</color> thinks everyone is a friend. But, I suppose a friend of his is an aquaintance of mine."
<<expression Nisaea happy>>
Jessamine:"Well out with it. What do you need, love?"
    <<jump JMD>>
===

title: JMD
---
<<lightenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Jessamine:"Victor sent you for a good reason. I'm certain of it."
<<darkenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"Right..."
    ->"Have you seen anything odd?"
        <<jump JNEUT1>>
    ->"Has anyone around you been acting strange?"
        <<jump JNEUT2>>
===

title: JNEUT1
---
<<lightenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Jessamine:"I'm a needleworker. I receive unique requests daily. Nothing substantial. Less orders as of late perhaps?" 
Jessamine:"More people have been interested in attending the demonstrations that some philosophers have been putting on. Hogwash if you ask me."
<<darkenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"They seem unqualified?"
<<lightenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Jessamine:"Hardly. They parrot strange, outlandish ideas. Tales that mirror magic more than natural sciences. I can hardly believe that people are eager to attend."
<<darkenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"I understand..."
<<if visited ("JNEUT2")>>
   <<jump JMD2>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump JMD>>
<<endif>>
===

title: JNEUT2
---
<<lightenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Jessamine:"I wouldn't say strange. When you work with your head down, people get used to not speaking in hushed voices around you."
Jessamine:"You tend to fade into the tapestry, become decoration if you understand my intention." 
Jessamine:"I've heard talk of poor behavior, but I have not seen any myself. That does not make me a reliable source."
<<darkenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"I see..."
<<if visited ("JNEUT1")>>
   <<jump JMD2>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump JMD>>
<<endif>>
===

title: JMD2
---
<<lightenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Jessamine:"I can try to offer you more, I just need to finish this piece and close up if you're willing to wait."
<<darkenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea:"Of course. Take your time."

Nisaea: <i>I wonder if I can find anything to help my search?</i>
<<hide_object "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<hide_object "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<reveal_object "Book">>
===

title: book
---
Narrator:A titleless book cleverly hides the contents of a second edition translation of The Pillow Book.
Narrator: Inside is a hastily written note signed by a "E.K" and a locket serving as a bookmark.
Narrator: The locket appears to contain a strand of jet black hair, while the surface plate is a bouquet of lavender.
<<reveal_object "Nisaea-FullBody">>
<<expression Nisaea Neutral>>
<<lightenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea: "How queer..."
<<hide_object "Nisaea-FullBody">>
    <<jump JMDPost>>
===

