title:JNL
---
<<hide_object "Warning">>
<<expression Jessa sad>>
 <<reveal_object "Warning">>
<<lightenCharacter "Jessa-FullBody">>
<<darkenCharacter "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Jessamine:"Then I'm afraid I'm bereft of words. It's more akin to to a feeling, really. Like when you miss several meals and your ribs start to ache?  But I'm still eating. I'm unsure if I'll ever be full again."
Jessamine:"My apologies..." 
<<hide_object "Warning">>
